@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox
title US0016 (Level 1) - Put a publication from my library for sale in an auction

actor User
participant System

User -> System : I want to sell a publication of my library as an auction
activate User
activate System
System --> User : Which library?
User -> System : myLibrary
System --> User : Which publication?
User -> System : publication
System --> User : Insert initialDate, finalDate, initialPrice, buyOutPrice
User -> System : provide data

System --> User : Done (Auction created)
deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
